WEBVTT

00:10:57.518 --> 00:11:01.811
It's about a proud woman
who has been to hell and back,

00:11:01.835 --> 00:11:04.235
from her journey across the Atlantic.

00:11:05.509 --> 00:11:07.514
She's exhausted,

00:11:07.538 --> 00:11:08.815
she's a queen,

00:11:08.839 --> 00:11:12.579
and in this section,
you're going to see she is triumphant.

00:11:12.942 --> 00:11:14.434
She made it,

00:11:14.458 --> 00:11:19.744
and she is, in that last
step that she does,

00:11:19.768 --> 00:11:23.228
beating away anything negative

00:11:23.252 --> 00:11:25.355
with her tremendous strength.

00:11:26.688 --> 00:11:31.145
And in the last step,
she digs into the earth